    {
      "confidence": "high",
      "created_at": "2026-08-31T13:20:29.135608+00:00",
      "dst": "source:resume",
      "excerpt": "Analytics and data platform engineer with 7+ years designing enterprise data products, cloud-native data platforms, and AI-enabled analytics across life sciences, manufacturing, retail, financial services, and supply chain. Builds modern data ecosystems on AWS, dbt, Snowflake, and Databricks, and integrates LLMs and knowledge graphs where they earn their place. Author of **knowledge-worker**, a published PyPI package giving AI assistants durable, provenance-backed memory: a local-first knowledge graph with graph analytics, LLM-backed ingest, and a hard provenance invariant. Generalist by nature \u2014 comfortable owning a problem from ingestion through modeling and tooling to the report on a stakeholder's desk \u2014 and experienced mentoring engineering teams and setting technical standards.",
      "last_seen": "2026-08-31T13:20:29.135609+00:00",
      "source_id": "source:resume",
